    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 831 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 8 miles southwest of Alliance, moving east at 20 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph and pea size hail. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible. Locations impacted include... Alliance and Alliance Municipal Airport.",
